cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Conductor, please cite it as below."
title: "Conductor: a harness for agentic robotics"
abstract: >-
  An orchestration harness around robot policies and VLAs: step-by-step
  instructions, per-step verification, a start-state contract with a recovery
  pose, and retries, each measured component by component. On LIBERO-Long it
  lifts a SmolVLA trained on LIBERO-90 from 0% to 67.8% success.
authors:
